    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA superb opportunity to acquire an elevated residential site of 0.118 acres in the highly sought-after Seafield area of Youghal. Enjoying superb distant sea views with a southerly aspect, close to Claycastle beach and Youghal/Midleton Greenway.\n\nThe site is offered for sale subject to planning permission, planning was previously granted on the sites in 2007 to construct a detached 3 bed dwelling. Planning Ref 07/58052.\n\nThe site is conveniently located less than five minutes from the N25, with both Cork and Waterford under an hour away. Youghal is also perfectly situated under 30 minutes from Midleton and Dungarvan, providing excellent commuting options. \n\nA picturesque and historic town, Youghal offers a wealth of amenities, including renowned schools, various supermarkets, cafes, restaurants, pubs, Greenway Youghal to Midleton, Boardwalk, golf course, and beautiful walking trails on local beaches."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>* 0.12 Acre Site </li><li></li><li>* Prime Location</li><li></li><li>* Close to beaches and local amenities</li><li></li><li>* Close to N25 Between Midleton and Dungarann.</li><li></li><li>* Mains Services available.</ul>"
      },
